WEBVTT

00:07.320 --> 00:10.260
Fall in love, boys and girls

00:10.690 --> 00:13.750
Twinkle! Put a star in your eye

00:14.600 --> 00:17.500
The passion, the way it was born

00:18.030 --> 00:21.020
Makes sparks in the jungle! Haré+Guu!

00:21.840 --> 00:25.000
How the hips shake, mucho dizzying

00:25.370 --> 00:28.400
Amigo, that's risky for a kid

00:28.810 --> 00:31.900
If I were to kiss, I'd get sucked in

00:32.450 --> 00:35.110
Tonight, I want to see something scary

00:35.980 --> 00:38.040
Don't be afraid

00:38.120 --> 00:39.590
Going from one push after another

00:39.590 --> 00:41.690
The surprising feeling is nice

00:41.690 --> 00:43.390
And you end up dancing till morning

00:43.390 --> 00:45.330
LOVE LOVE LOVE

00:45.330 --> 00:48.690
TROPICANA

00:50.660 --> 00:53.760
Catch me in the shade under the palm tree

00:54.100 --> 00:57.370
Make me wait, more than down to the limit

00:57.840 --> 01:00.860
I'm sorry, but you're already addicted

01:01.280 --> 01:04.610
From the jungle you can't escape! Haré+Guu!

01:05.180 --> 01:08.050
Fall in love, boys and girls

01:08.720 --> 01:11.780
Twinkle! Put a star in your eye

01:12.250 --> 01:15.350
The passion, the way it was born

01:15.990 --> 01:19.190
Makes sparks in the jungle! Haré+Guu!

01:33.950 --> 01:35.080
It's morning?

01:38.190 --> 01:40.280
But, I want to sleep in a bit more...

01:41.160 --> 01:44.180
I don't have to worry about breakfast
because Bell is here...

01:48.970 --> 01:51.490
Mom is warm...

01:53.700 --> 01:55.260
Weda-chan...

01:59.710 --> 02:00.870
Warm...

02:01.240 --> 02:03.210
What the hell are you doing here!?

02:03.710 --> 02:06.200
Mom! Wake up! Get up, Mom!

02:07.780 --> 02:09.010
Ah, Good morning.

02:09.090 --> 02:10.950
Mom, what's the meaning of this!?

02:13.660 --> 02:15.060
This is the doctor.

02:15.060 --> 02:17.250
I'm not asking who he is!

02:17.330 --> 02:19.260
Bell! Ashio! Intruder alert!

02:19.700 --> 02:20.830
What!?

02:20.830 --> 02:23.920
You again!? You perverted wild dog in heat!

02:24.170 --> 02:25.700
Send him back to the nurse's office!

02:25.700 --> 02:26.290
Roger!

02:26.370 --> 02:27.370
Stop it!

02:27.370 --> 02:30.270
The nurse's office is the most dangerous
spot in all of the village!

02:30.270 --> 02:31.400
I don't care!

02:31.610 --> 02:35.810
You know, old Dama is still stalking the
doctor.

02:35.880 --> 02:37.180
Isn't that a big deal?

02:37.250 --> 02:39.940
But that doesn't mean that you can let him
sleep next to you.

02:40.480 --> 02:44.890
Geez, you can't really relax on this bed when
there are two adults sleeping in it!

02:44.950 --> 02:46.650
There's no way you can fit four people here!

02:46.960 --> 02:48.290
Hey, by the way, where's Guu?

02:48.360 --> 02:50.150
Where's she sleeping?

02:50.230 --> 02:51.220
You called?

02:52.500 --> 02:53.760
The pillow!?

02:54.200 --> 02:58.000
As a freeloader, I should know my place...

02:59.140 --> 03:02.400
But, that doesn't mean that you need to
become a pillow.

03:07.580 --> 03:09.840
DELUXE

03:10.110 --> 03:12.280
Oh, I'm so pissed off at that school doc!

03:12.280 --> 03:14.180
I want to do something about him!

03:14.250 --> 03:15.880
Then do something.

03:15.990 --> 03:18.010
If I could, I would have done it long ago!

03:19.060 --> 03:25.090
You know, somehow, I think that at the way
things are going, maybe the doc is going to
take my place or something.

03:25.330 --> 03:28.600
The doc is getting more and more
demanding nowadays...

03:28.600 --> 03:31.160
...and Mom doesn't seem to mind it at all.

03:31.670 --> 03:35.630
Maybe they'll keep going like this until
they're back together.

03:36.610 --> 03:39.510
And if that happens, where would I go?

03:41.880 --> 03:46.840
So, in other words, you want him to hook up
with another woman.

03:47.050 --> 03:48.680
...Y-Yeah, that's right.

03:49.890 --> 03:53.840
But is there any woman in this village who
could fall in love with him?

03:54.220 --> 03:55.710
For instance, Rebecca.

03:55.790 --> 03:57.280
That's impossible.

03:57.660 --> 04:00.060
Even if they were to get along...

04:01.460 --> 04:04.520
...the pokutes that look after Rebecca won't
stand for it.

04:04.600 --> 04:06.300
I'm sure that they'll eat up the doctor.

04:06.540 --> 04:07.730
Then, Ravenna.

04:07.800 --> 04:09.330
Ravenna?

04:10.040 --> 04:11.700
That's a crime!

04:11.870 --> 04:13.240
Then, how about Marie?

04:13.740 --> 04:16.610
An even bigger crime!
No, no, no, absolutely not!

04:16.850 --> 04:17.940
Then, Addy.

04:18.050 --> 04:20.710
That's impossible. Addy has Chet.

04:20.820 --> 04:25.080
Guu would love to see a love triangle battle.

04:25.150 --> 04:26.210
I don't need to see that!

04:26.290 --> 04:27.760
A long shot: Bell.

04:29.630 --> 04:30.960
That's never gonna happen.

04:31.060 --> 04:32.460
Then, how about Ashio?

04:32.530 --> 04:33.590
That's going too far!

04:33.660 --> 04:35.790
Lazy, Gupta, Uighur, Seiichi...

04:35.870 --> 04:37.200
No yaoi!

04:37.270 --> 04:38.800
Dog, cat, monkey, peacock, bear, pokute...

04:38.800 --> 04:39.570
No animals!
Dog, cat, monkey, peacock, bear, pokute...

04:39.570 --> 04:40.540
No animals!

04:40.740 --> 04:43.360
Then, we only have one choice left.

04:44.070 --> 04:47.200
You know, there's that one person totally in
love with him.

04:48.510 --> 04:52.350
Well, er, I think that's off limits,
or at least unfair.

04:52.410 --> 04:55.250
She thinks the doctor is her dead husband.

04:55.350 --> 04:57.980
No, no, no.
That's a wonderful romance in itself.

04:58.050 --> 05:00.280
How about you fulfill her wish?

05:00.390 --> 05:02.790
I don't really want to see Dama like that...

05:02.860 --> 05:06.230
Dama's love comes to fruit, and you won't
have to worry about the doctor anymore.

05:06.230 --> 05:08.560
The idea is full of positives!

05:08.560 --> 05:09.530
Yatta!

05:09.670 --> 05:11.930
Yatta! Yatta! Yatta! Yatta!

05:12.000 --> 05:14.940
It's good for old Dama also, huh...

05:15.370 --> 05:18.200
Maybe Guu does consider other people?

05:19.240 --> 05:22.570
And so, let's go set Dama
on the scent right away.

05:22.650 --> 05:24.550
Put her on the scent? Is Dama a hunting dog
or something?

05:26.150 --> 05:28.510
Well, speak of the devil.

05:28.580 --> 05:30.380
Actually, she seems to be
in a really good mood.

05:30.450 --> 05:31.380
Here goes...

05:31.450 --> 05:32.250
Hey! Hey!

05:33.320 --> 05:34.720
Oh, it's you, Haré.

05:34.790 --> 05:37.290
Y-You know,
the school doc was calling for you.

05:37.290 --> 05:39.120
He said he'll be waiting in the nurse's office.

05:39.230 --> 05:40.660
Grandpa?

05:41.160 --> 05:42.430
Grandpa is!?

05:42.500 --> 05:44.360
Grandpa wants me!?

05:44.430 --> 05:46.590
Passionately? Sweetly? Kindly?

05:46.700 --> 05:48.800
Oh, I'll be right over!

05:51.440 --> 05:53.030
T-Terrifying!

05:53.910 --> 05:56.280
No, no. I shouldn't think like that.

05:56.350 --> 05:59.470
Guu is seriously concerned about Dama's
romance too, you know...

05:59.820 --> 06:01.720
Such a ghastly woman.

06:02.590 --> 06:03.520
You...

06:08.420 --> 06:13.620
Ah... despite everything, my room is where I
can feel most relaxed.

06:14.730 --> 06:18.220
I feel at ease when I smell this medicinal air.

06:18.470 --> 06:20.870
If I didn't have to worry about that old hag...

06:20.940 --> 06:23.270
I would call Weda-chan over...

06:57.710 --> 06:59.970
Could someone be standing just outside the
door?

07:00.440 --> 07:02.670
No, it must be just me.

07:03.450 --> 07:07.040
I'm too nervous about everything lately... It's
bad for me.

07:14.090 --> 07:16.180
W-W-W-W-What should I do?

07:16.260 --> 07:18.520
T-That's right, I locked the door...

07:18.590 --> 07:19.720
I'm all right. It's okay.

08:08.240 --> 08:09.900
I can't stay in this room after all...

08:09.980 --> 08:12.210
All right! School is in session right now...

08:12.210 --> 08:13.550
...so I'll go to Weda-chan's place!

08:16.050 --> 08:18.110
I-I can't stand up...

08:18.190 --> 08:19.780
This is so pathetic.

08:20.020 --> 08:23.650
Geez, why do I have to go through all of this?

08:24.290 --> 08:26.890
In the first place, I've never been this kind of
guy...

08:26.960 --> 08:29.130
You know, I'm more of the calm, cool type.

08:29.130 --> 08:34.190
And though I'm not the most sought-after
guy in the world, I should be relatively close
to it...

08:34.270 --> 08:37.830
But the way things are going, I feel so filthy,
or rather, totally worthless.

08:50.050 --> 08:51.880
I wonder if the doc's all right...

08:51.950 --> 08:54.080
Old Dama seemed rather feisty.

08:54.160 --> 08:55.450
I'm a little bit worried.

08:55.520 --> 08:56.290
Haré.

08:56.590 --> 08:59.030
You're not very energetic today, Haré.
Is something wrong?

08:59.030 --> 09:02.720
O-Oh no, not at all, I'm fine.

09:04.470 --> 09:05.870
W-What's that!? A scream?

09:05.930 --> 09:06.730
Can it be?

09:07.140 --> 09:08.630
The story up to this point:

09:08.770 --> 09:11.710
It all started on an ordinary day.

09:11.940 --> 09:13.870
I'm late! I'm late!

09:16.810 --> 09:18.780
That hurt!

09:18.780 --> 09:20.080
Were you looking where you were running?

09:22.080 --> 09:23.710
It was a meeting arranged by fate.

09:24.150 --> 09:25.980
Congratulations!

09:26.390 --> 09:30.920
However, their happiness together did not
last long.

09:34.700 --> 09:37.860
The reality of war severed the two apart.

09:38.100 --> 09:39.870
The man left for the battlefield...

09:39.870 --> 09:43.240
...and the woman could do nothing but to
wait for his return...

09:43.810 --> 09:45.970
The woman waited for many years.

09:47.680 --> 09:50.200
The war finally ended.

09:51.180 --> 09:54.050
But the man did not return.

09:55.650 --> 09:57.690
The woman waited even longer...

09:57.690 --> 10:01.020
...believing that one day the man would come
home with a smile on his face.

10:01.560 --> 10:02.490
Then finally...

10:04.830 --> 10:06.590
...the man came home.

10:06.660 --> 10:10.600
Everyone thought that a simple happiness
would befall the two of them.

10:10.600 --> 10:11.760
However...

10:12.940 --> 10:15.340
...the man had lost all of his memory...

10:16.810 --> 10:20.900
The woman sacrificed everything to take
care of the man...

10:21.140 --> 10:24.870
...for the day that he would remember
everything they had shared.

10:25.480 --> 10:28.080
And finally, that day was to come.

10:29.820 --> 10:31.010
Grandpa?

10:31.090 --> 10:34.490
And that's the story that's been playing
inside her head.

10:34.560 --> 10:37.180
You remembered me!!

10:38.230 --> 10:39.220
Grandpa?

10:39.290 --> 10:41.320
You remembered me!!

10:41.530 --> 10:43.260
What are you talking about!?

10:45.970 --> 10:48.270
Grandpa!!

11:22.100 --> 11:25.230
NOOOOOO!!

11:28.380 --> 11:29.540
Grandpa!!

11:29.650 --> 11:32.480
Grandpa!!

11:39.450 --> 11:40.480
It's no use...

11:56.670 --> 11:57.700
This is...

11:57.970 --> 11:59.440
What happened here?

11:59.780 --> 12:02.110
Is this my fault?

12:02.180 --> 12:05.370
Did all of this happen because I told Dama
something strange?

12:05.480 --> 12:08.450
But, how did things end up like this?

12:08.520 --> 12:11.180
Looks like the doc's no longer in the room.

12:11.450 --> 12:14.290
I wonder if some large beast assaulted him.

12:14.360 --> 12:17.220
Maybe a beast grabbed the doc, and dragged
him back to its den.

12:17.430 --> 12:20.690
That means, it's feeding the doc to its hungry
children.

12:20.760 --> 12:25.560
Oh, no! It's not for certain that Dr. Clive has
been taken by a wild beast.

12:25.930 --> 12:28.560
Well, we're not sure that it's all old Dama's
fault, either...

12:28.670 --> 12:30.510
Maybe the pokutes took him away.

12:30.510 --> 12:34.540
You know, that old village legend that if you
eat too many pokutes, the pokutes will seek
revenge on you...

12:34.540 --> 12:37.100
I'm sure that the school doc was eaten by the
pokutes.

12:37.180 --> 12:39.310
The window has a heart-shaped hole in it.

12:39.380 --> 12:41.280
This is something too complex for a beast to
make.

12:41.350 --> 12:42.820
That means, it was a human?

12:43.020 --> 12:43.880
Giku!

12:43.950 --> 12:46.960
Oh, that's right, maybe a bird of paradise
took him away.

12:46.960 --> 12:49.690
You know, I remember some village legend
that if you eat too many birds of paradise,

12:49.690 --> 12:52.390
...they will seek revenge on you or something
like that...

12:52.560 --> 12:54.090
I wonder what this is?

12:54.230 --> 12:55.590
Is it a dying message?

12:55.660 --> 12:56.930
But, why is it "Love"?

12:57.200 --> 12:58.630
Is this lipstick?

12:58.700 --> 12:59.870
Now that you mention it...

12:59.870 --> 13:00.730
That means...

13:00.800 --> 13:02.570
No, no, no! Not good...

13:02.640 --> 13:03.830
I know, I get it!

13:03.910 --> 13:05.460
It was manda that took the school doc away!

13:05.540 --> 13:07.910
Manda squirts red jam out, and this red stuff
is jam.

13:07.980 --> 13:10.740
The old village legend has it that if you eat
too many mandas, they will seek revenge...

13:10.810 --> 13:15.880
H-Hey, could this be something that Dr. Clive
ripped off when he was assaulted?

13:16.020 --> 13:16.750
Is it hair?

13:16.920 --> 13:19.010
Oh, it's so obviously Dama!

13:20.090 --> 13:21.650
Can this hair be...

13:21.760 --> 13:24.420
Oh, no! They'll catch on for sure now that it
was old Dama!

13:22.490 --> 13:25.590
...my old man?

13:25.660 --> 13:27.750
The elder? That's even worse!

13:29.300 --> 13:30.390
Welcome back.

13:31.170 --> 13:32.220
I'm home.

13:32.830 --> 13:34.100
Wait, what's that?

13:34.470 --> 13:35.800
This is the doctor.

13:35.870 --> 13:37.600
That's not what I'm asking.

13:37.970 --> 13:40.740
Hey, doctor... So, what happened?

13:44.680 --> 13:46.180
Weda-chan!

13:46.180 --> 13:48.780
Oh, wait a minute! What happened?

13:48.850 --> 13:49.980
Haré, do you know anything?

13:51.590 --> 13:52.350
I can't tell her!

13:52.420 --> 13:56.760
I can't tell her that he got assaulted because I
told old Dama something I shouldn't have.

13:57.190 --> 13:59.850
Hey, Guu-chan. Do you know anything?

14:00.330 --> 14:01.990
Let's see...

14:02.060 --> 14:03.620
When did she!?

14:04.900 --> 14:07.100
I think I know...

14:07.500 --> 14:09.490
...but I might not...

14:09.570 --> 14:10.730
And she's playing coy!

14:10.810 --> 14:16.400
I wonder what she'd think if she found out
that the doc had a terrible time because of
you Haré? Hmm?

14:16.480 --> 14:17.970
What she'd think?

14:19.310 --> 14:21.380
Oh, that's such a horrible thing to do!

14:21.380 --> 14:23.150
I feel so sorry for the doctor!

14:23.220 --> 14:24.950
I'll cheer you up.

14:25.450 --> 14:26.420
Weda-chan...

14:27.160 --> 14:29.450
Haré who does such cruel things, goodbye!

14:29.520 --> 14:30.510
Bye-bye!

14:32.190 --> 14:33.400
Not good! No, no! Not good at all!

14:33.400 --> 14:34.760
What should I do? What should I do?
What should I do?

14:34.830 --> 14:37.630
You can't tell them. You really can't tell them.
Seriously, for real, got that!?

14:39.200 --> 14:40.900
Sure. I won't tell them.

14:41.140 --> 14:42.000
You're definitely going to do it.

14:42.070 --> 14:44.300
Hey, Weda-san.

14:44.370 --> 14:45.810
You're going to tell her already!?

14:45.870 --> 14:47.710
I've got an earful of good information.

14:47.710 --> 14:48.800
Stop it!!

14:48.880 --> 14:52.540
You want me to tell you who did all of this to
the school doc?

14:52.610 --> 14:54.850
Oh, who? Who did such a cruel thing?

14:54.850 --> 14:56.020
NOOOOO!

14:56.020 --> 14:56.920
It was...
NOOOOO!

14:56.920 --> 14:57.780
Weda!

14:57.850 --> 14:59.510
Oh, Rebecca, what is it?

14:59.720 --> 15:02.160
I bought some new beer that just came out!
How about it?

15:02.420 --> 15:03.550
I'll drink!

15:03.630 --> 15:05.330
Then, I'll see you later, doc!

15:05.330 --> 15:07.660
Guu-chan, I'll listen to the rest of the story
later.

15:07.660 --> 15:10.600
Haré, when Bell gets home, make up some
story for me, okay?

15:10.600 --> 15:11.330
See ya!

15:12.600 --> 15:16.040
Ah...

15:16.770 --> 15:18.100
...no fun.

15:18.270 --> 15:19.740
She can't be serious...

15:21.410 --> 15:22.770
Weda-chan...

15:22.840 --> 15:23.670
Hey!

15:23.750 --> 15:26.240
Weda-chan...

15:26.720 --> 15:29.510
This isn't what I wanted...

15:29.850 --> 15:33.120
I did think that I wanted the doc to do
something, but...

15:33.190 --> 15:34.420
...this isn't it!

15:34.490 --> 15:36.480
Geez, get a grip, doc!

15:38.060 --> 15:40.260
It's all over for me...

15:40.260 --> 15:43.870
No matter what I do or where I go, I'm
destined to have that old hag chase after me.

15:43.870 --> 15:45.830
Weda-chan throws me away, too...

15:45.830 --> 15:47.630
Mom has nothing to do with it!

15:47.700 --> 15:50.870
It's all right now... I'm just... I'm just a...

15:52.440 --> 15:54.670
I... I...

15:55.810 --> 15:57.470
I'll do something about it!

15:58.150 --> 15:58.870
That's right.

15:58.950 --> 16:04.320
This is all because I was jealous
and thought that the doc was taking my spot
in our family.

16:04.550 --> 16:06.020
I have to do something about it.

16:06.390 --> 16:07.690
Come on, think hard...

16:07.760 --> 16:10.450
In the first place, why is old Dama in love
with the doc?

16:10.830 --> 16:11.720
No, that's not it.

16:11.790 --> 16:16.160
It's not that she's in love with the doc.
She's mistaking the doc for her husband...

16:16.630 --> 16:18.060
...although they look nothing alike.

16:18.630 --> 16:20.160
So why did she make that mistake?

16:21.770 --> 16:26.000
Grandpa had such a
wonderful head of white hair!

16:27.480 --> 16:28.740
That's it!

16:28.910 --> 16:30.000
The reason is...

16:30.610 --> 16:31.600
...his hair!

16:32.280 --> 16:33.710
Eh? Dye my hair?

16:33.780 --> 16:34.820
No way.

16:34.820 --> 16:37.050
My hair's damaged enough already
from the bleach.

16:37.650 --> 16:40.420
It'll all die if I color it again.

16:40.520 --> 16:41.920
You want to be assaulted again?

16:42.660 --> 16:43.990
True.

16:43.990 --> 16:45.790
Hair is not something that I should
throw my life away for.

16:45.860 --> 16:47.190
His life?

16:47.260 --> 16:49.250
What horrible things happened to him?

16:49.760 --> 16:50.820
Stay still!

16:51.070 --> 16:52.060
Guu, do it.

16:53.000 --> 16:54.300
W-Wait a...

16:58.010 --> 17:01.700
Oh brother. I really liked it white.

17:01.810 --> 17:04.400
I hope you can guarantee that this will make
things all right.

17:04.550 --> 17:06.210
Yeah, I can guarantee it. Probably.

17:06.280 --> 17:09.480
What do you mean, "probably guarantee"?
That's a contradiction.

17:09.550 --> 17:14.420
Rest assured... I thought something like this
might happen, so I brought the ultimate
relaxation item.

17:14.690 --> 17:15.520
This.

17:15.960 --> 17:16.980
What is it?

17:17.090 --> 17:20.060
It's a radar that shows enemies approaching.

17:20.130 --> 17:22.220
If she comes, we'll know immediately.

17:23.000 --> 17:25.020
It uses 8 MP.

17:25.100 --> 17:28.190
What's with the MP? It seems rather
suspicious...

17:31.310 --> 17:33.270
S-S-S-She's here!!

17:40.520 --> 17:42.210
70 more meters.

17:46.320 --> 17:47.850
60 more meters.

17:48.190 --> 17:49.710
Doc, stay still.

17:49.890 --> 17:51.620
S-Sure.

17:55.530 --> 17:57.160
Boom!

17:57.770 --> 17:59.360
What the hell are you doing!?

17:59.430 --> 18:00.200
Had to be done.

18:00.270 --> 18:02.260
Please, not now!

18:05.170 --> 18:06.870
S-She's really close!

18:08.410 --> 18:10.280
It's all over!

18:10.350 --> 18:13.110
It's not over! I'm here with you,
so don't worry!

18:18.890 --> 18:20.450
5 meters...

18:20.820 --> 18:23.260
4... 3... 2!

18:25.930 --> 18:27.900
Dama split up!?

18:29.930 --> 18:31.330
1 meter...

18:32.100 --> 18:33.230
50 centimeters...

18:34.340 --> 18:35.100
Zero!

18:35.300 --> 18:36.270
Strange...

18:36.370 --> 18:38.400
I don't see anything.

18:39.670 --> 18:40.500
Wait a second!

18:41.840 --> 18:42.970
She's on the rooftop!?

18:47.450 --> 18:49.420
What the hell are you doing!?

18:49.480 --> 18:50.750
Oh, I couldn't help it.

18:50.820 --> 18:52.750
What do you mean, you couldn't help it!?

18:53.390 --> 18:55.860
Jeez! There are pranks you can pull, and
then there's going too far...

19:39.300 --> 19:40.900
Grandpa...

19:40.900 --> 19:42.870
...where did he go?

19:59.050 --> 20:00.790
We did it! Alright! We did it!

20:00.790 --> 20:03.060
See, see, see! What did I tell you?

20:03.060 --> 20:05.420
It's all right if you trust me.

20:07.130 --> 20:08.360
Thanks.

20:08.430 --> 20:10.020
You're a good kid!

20:11.700 --> 20:12.790
A good kid...

20:13.640 --> 20:15.600
He's sounding like a dad.

20:15.870 --> 20:18.430
Right now, he had a really gentle
look on his face...

20:18.810 --> 20:24.010
Only those that know true pain hold true
kindness in their hands.

20:25.380 --> 20:26.680
I see...

20:26.750 --> 20:29.840
He felt true pain for the first time
after being assaulted by Dama...

20:29.920 --> 20:32.680
And so that's why he's gotten kinder to
people.

20:33.990 --> 20:35.180
I'm home...

20:35.320 --> 20:38.050
Oh? Doctor, what's up with that hair?

20:38.230 --> 20:39.780
Oh, nothing much.

20:39.860 --> 20:42.390
His attitude seems to have softened, too.

20:42.860 --> 20:44.560
You look cool, doctor!

20:45.170 --> 20:46.130
You think so?

20:46.370 --> 20:47.160
So typical.

20:47.740 --> 20:48.720
That response is too typical.

20:48.800 --> 20:50.170
You look young and handsome.

20:50.240 --> 20:52.800
It's not just my appearance that's young.

20:52.870 --> 20:55.240
How about I show you tonight in my room?

20:55.310 --> 20:56.300
Or maybe even right here?

20:56.440 --> 20:57.180
Oh, stop it.

20:57.180 --> 20:58.350
Get out!!

20:58.350 --> 21:00.840
You, shut up!
Why don't you be considerate and get out!?

21:01.050 --> 21:03.790
Who the hell do you think freed you from
Dama's evil clutches!?

21:03.790 --> 21:04.790
Like I care!

21:04.790 --> 21:06.320
I-I-I-I'll get you!!

21:06.320 --> 21:08.310
Try if you can, stupid.

21:18.800 --> 21:21.360
All right. Let's have a drink. It'll be on me.

21:21.440 --> 21:22.660
I'll keep you company till you drop.

21:22.740 --> 21:24.710
Shut up. Don't be nice to me.

22:34.900 --> 22:36.830
NEXT EPISODE

22:36.900 --> 22:38.600
I'm rather tired lately...

22:38.600 --> 22:41.040
I can't relax at home since Bell and Ashio arrived.

22:41.040 --> 22:42.470
But Marie is always so energetic...

22:42.470 --> 22:44.270
It's fun to play with such a cheerful Marie,
but honestly, it tires me out.

22:44.270 --> 22:45.040
It's fun to play with such a cheerful Marie,
but honestly, it tires me out.

22:45.040 --> 22:46.980
I wish Marie was just a little bit more calm...

22:46.980 --> 22:48.540
Hey, Guu, what are you up to!?

22:48.540 --> 22:52.520
Well, this is between you and me,
but I can change people's personalities
with the wave of a wand.

22:52.520 --> 22:53.250
What's up with that?

22:53.250 --> 22:54.650
In the first place, I'm not that dissatisfied!

22:54.650 --> 22:56.750
Even if I tell you to stop, I know things will
end up in an awful situation!

22:56.750 --> 22:59.060
Oh, you hush.
It's all right if Guu can have fun.

22:59.060 --> 22:59.920
Stop it! Stop it!

22:59.920 --> 23:00.890
Stop it! Stop it!

23:00.890 --> 23:04.460
Next episode of Haré+Guu: "Sha-Lan-La"
